# ATTACK SPELLS 

[SPELL]
<SPHERE>:ATTACK
<NAME>:Verlangsamen
<TARGET_ALIGNMENT>:EVIL
<TARGET>:CHARACTER
<CAST_TIME>:1
<MANA>:10
<ICON>:ICONS/spellslow.png:ICONS/spellslowa.png
<DESCRIPTION>:Ziel auf 60% Geschwindigkeit.\nDauer 10 Sek.\n+1 Sekunde pro Angriffsstufe.

[EFFECT]
<NAME>:SLOW
<EXCLUSIVE>:1
<MESSAGE>:Verlangsamt!
<ACTIVATION>:USAGE
<TYPE>:PERCENTSPEED
<DURATION>:10
<VALUE>:-40
<DURATION_BONUS>:1
[/EFFECT]

[EFFECT]
<NAME>:SLOWATTACK
<EXCLUSIVE>:1
<ACTIVATION>:USAGE
<TYPE>:PERCENTATTACKSPEED
<DURATION>:10
<VALUE>:-40
<DURATION_BONUS>:1
[/EFFECT]

#SFX:TYPE:DURATION:LOOPING:SPEED:TURNRATE:PATH TO EFFECT:EXCLUSIVE:RESPECT BONUSES

<SFX>:FOLLOWTARGET:10:1:0:0:SPELLS/EFFECTS/STAMINA/slow.mdl:1:1
<SFX>:FOLLOWTARGET:.5:1:0:0:SPELLS/EFFECTS/FIREPUFF/purplepuff.mdl:0:0
<SFX_DURATION_BONUS>:1
